| width_cm | prediction | effective_n | nearest_distance | status |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | :--- |
| -1.0 | nan | nan | 1.447954 | no_support |
| 0.2 | 1.454167 | 48 | 0.000000 | ok |
